BJc2STQdl42X5","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":16,"usage":null},{"content":"I checked the SIM card status, and it says that no SIM card is detected in the phone. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:25:19.731775","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":28,"prompt_tokens":2885}},{"content":"Since your phone is not detecting the SIM card, the next step is to reseat the SIM card. Please follow these steps:\n\n1. Power off your phone.\n2. Remove the SIM card tray and take out the SIM card.\n3. Carefully reinsert the SIM card, making sure it’s properly aligned.\n4. Put the tray back in and power your phone back on.\n\nAfter your phone restarts, check if the SIM card is detected and if you have service. Let me know if this resolves the issue or if you still see “No SIM card detected.”","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:25:21.035979","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":117,"prompt_tokens":7040}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:25:22.068191","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_TOMe0T0Srs87VKfaFH4fCQxn","name":"reseat_sim_card","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":3034}},{"content":"SIM card re-seated successfully.\nStatus Bar: 📵 No Signal | 📵 Data Disabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp